module test.audit_runtime.presburger_relevance.

% Residual Presburger constraints on a generated variable remain observable
% when a named query variable reaches that generated variable through the final
% substitution or through another retained residual.  The suite also checks a
% transitive substitution chain, an evaluation-residual connection, two
% Presburger residuals in both source orders, the equivalent non-Presburger
% control, and a truly hidden sigma variable whose satisfiable Presburger
% witness may still be omitted.
